WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:03,210
You have extraordinary talents and strength

2
00:00:03,210 --> 00:00:06,210
I can open a camp for you if you want.

3
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:08,210
I am too free-spirited to be a general.

4
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:11,210
Give me a high-risk mission, preferably with panties as a reward

5
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:14,980
You can choose the reward for your meritorious service

6
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:16,980
Hongying, is there something wrong with Bo Geng?

7
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:18,980
Why is it rocking back and forth?

8
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:22,330
The one who has been busy with everything lately

9
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:25,330
General Hongying is really hardworking.

10
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:28,420
General Hongying, have you finished your report?

11
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:30,420
The queen has also arranged a new task for you, right?

12
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:31,490
arranged

13
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:34,490
Then hurry up and give me and the queen some space.

14
00:00:34,490 --> 00:00:37,680
Then Queen, I will take my leave first.

15
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:40,680
Go Queen Ankang

16
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:44,900
General Hongying, we can be considered friends.

17
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:47,900
If you have any difficulties in the future, come to me to help you.

18
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:52,850
Of course, if you have good resources, don’t forget me.

19
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:54,850
Where is the most dangerous place?

20
00:00:54,850 --> 00:00:55,850
Nine Realms Holy Land

21
00:00:55,850 --> 00:00:58,880
The top experts from the nine tribes are competing for resources there.

22
00:00:58,880 --> 00:01:00,880
We can't lose an inch of ground

23
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:03,880
How strong is he? Is he ninth grade old?

24
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:04,880
But the old is old

25
00:01:04,880 --> 00:01:07,940
The crippled crippled queen

26
00:01:07,940 --> 00:01:11,940
Why did you come here in my place, Great Ancestor?
